		{
			"id": "KAWSF4Lg",
			"type": "text",
			"x": 18931.085477373257,
			"y": 321.95097303226976,
			"width": 503.25970458984375,
			"height": 800,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#ffffff",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [
				"e_GlX3m6ST--TfwWjxWWW"
			],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "bdM",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 752208334,
			"version": 1199,
			"versionNonce": 2088543138,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1781640880906,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- internal use, globally distributed\n- diagnose latency crashes\n- metrics what?\n        - cpu load\n        - mem. usage\n        - disk consumption\n    - RPS/QPS\n        - create baseline\n    - uptime\n        - 99.9%\n    - not business metrics\n    - resolution\n        - 1 year retention\n        - raw data 7 days\n        - 1m 30 days\n        - 1h 1 yr\n- traces where?\n    - uuid requests across services\n    - head - 1% \n    - tail - log eth until request are completed \n    - headtail - hybrid\n        - configure when to change from head to tail\n- logs why? \n    - configure log level\n    - head - 1%\n- alerts\n    - PagerDuty\n    - HTTPS endpoints\n- google search\n    - 6.4B searches daily\n    - 1k pools -> 100 machines -> 100 metrics\n    - ~10M metrics daily    ",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- internal use, globally distributed\n- diagnose latency crashes\n- metrics what?\n        - cpu load\n        - mem. usage\n        - disk consumption\n    - RPS/QPS\n        - create baseline\n    - uptime\n        - 99.9%\n    - not business metrics\n    - resolution\n        - 1 year retention\n        - raw data 7 days\n        - 1m 30 days\n        - 1h 1 yr\n- traces where?\n    - uuid requests across services\n    - head - 1% \n    - tail - log eth until request are completed \n    - headtail - hybrid\n        - configure when to change from head to tail\n- logs why? \n    - configure log level\n    - head - 1%\n- alerts\n    - PagerDuty\n    - HTTPS endpoints\n- google search\n    - 6.4B searches daily\n    - 1k pools -> 100 machines -> 100 metrics\n    - ~10M metrics daily    ",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": ""
		},
