			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": null,
			"updated": 1781635331433,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- payment back for e-commerce app like Amazon.com\n- support credit card as example, irl all payment options would be supported\n- 3rd party handles payment processing, e.g. Stripe\n- rely on 3rd party payment processors to handle sensitive credit card data\n- app is global but assume one currency\n- 1M transactions per day\n- pay-in and pay-out flows\n- reconciliation process",
			"rawText": "- payment back for e-commerce app like Amazon.com\n- support credit card as example, irl all payment options would be supported\n- 3rd party handles payment processing, e.g. Stripe\n- rely on 3rd party payment processors to handle sensitive credit card data\n- app is global but assume one currency\n- 1M transactions per day\n- pay-in and pay-out flows\n- reconciliation process",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- payment back for e-commerce app like Amazon.com\n- support credit card as example, irl all payment options would be supported\n- 3rd party handles payment processing, e.g. Stripe\n- rely on 3rd party payment processors to handle sensitive credit card data\n- app is global but assume one currency\n- 1M transactions per day\n- pay-in and pay-out flows\n- reconciliation process",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false
		},
